      {/* ===== MARQUEE ===== */}
      <div className="dmp-marq" aria-hidden="true">
        <div className="dmp-marq-t">
          {[0, 1].map((n) => (
            <div className="dmp-marq-g" key={n}>
              {["Seo", "Google Ads", "Social media", "Meta Ads", "Content", "Email", "Analytics"].map((w, i) => (<span key={w}><b className={i % 2 ? "o" : ""}>{w}</b><i /></span>))}
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* ===== OVERVIEW ===== */}
      <section className="dmp-sec dmp-over" id="dmp-overview">
        <div className="dmp-in dmp-two">
          <div className="dmp-over-t">
            <span className="dmp-eye" data-up>Digital marketing in Dubai</span>
            <h2 className="dmp-h2 left" data-up>What a Dubai digital marketing agency does</h2>
            <p data-up>A digital marketing agency in Dubai helps a business get found, trusted and chosen online. That covers marketing as a whole: search engine optimization, paid ads, social media, content, email and measurement. People also call it online marketing or internet marketing. The goal is the same: bring the right customers to you at a cost that makes sense.</p>
            <p data-up>Good digital marketing starts with strategy, not with tools. Who are your customers? Which channels do they use? What is a lead worth? Only then do you choose the mix of channels and budget.</p>
            <p data-up>In a fast, competitive market like Dubai, that mix often combines search and Google Ads, social media, messaging and Google Maps. Softsaro runs these together, so your message, tracking and reporting stay consistent.</p>
          </div>
          <div className="dmp-mix" data-up>
            <div className="dmp-mix-h"><small>Digital marketing Dubai</small><b>The digital marketing channel mix for Dubai</b><span>Pick channels by goal, not by trend.</span></div>
            <ul>{MIX.map((m, i) => (<li key={m[0]} data-up style={st(i)}><i>{i + 1}</i><b>{m[0]}</b><span>{m[1]}</span></li>))}</ul>
            <div className="dmp-mix-f"><b>SOFTSARO</b><span>softsaro.com.np</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

